ed on elements, characters and products can be interactively displayed, covering categories such as clothing, beauty, 3C, etc. Help merchants to produce high-quality marketing materials in batches, efficiently and at low cost.","title":"E-commerce and Marketing Platform","video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-3-global.038434fdc4f93199.mp4"}],"modelUpgradeNotice":"Video V2.5 Turbo model API and Avatar API are now available","models":[{"name":"Video Generation","taskTypes":["Text to Video","Image to Video","Video Extension","Lip Sync","Video Effects","Elements Reference"],"video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-video-bg.cb39536e7c0db6b4.mp4"},{"image":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-image-bg.b4d28687b1639508.png","name":"Image Generation","taskTypes":["Text to Image","Image to Image"]},{"image":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-other-bg.b9d03458735fd5bf.png","name":"Intelligent Scenarios","taskTypes":["Virtual Try-on"]}],"productFeatures":{"desc":"","productFeaturesList":[{"commentary":"Connect to the KLing Video LargeModel, seamlessly integrate text-to-video.image-to-video, lip sync, motion brush, AI effects, and other cutting-edge video generation capabilities.","list":[{"media":{"prompt":"The camera passes through the coral cave from a first person perspective, at high speed","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-1.6900686236fd8a15.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Text to Video"},{"media":{"prompt":"The man slowly floated up with his eyes closed, and the camera followed him up slowly, his limbs naturally","referImageRight":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ttv.bf155b7345c70c00.png","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-pr