ned red Ford Mustang convertible driving in the desert, with blue sky and clouds overhead. The car was parked on very dry, cracked brown sand. Oil painting style with heavy brushstrokes.","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ttp.cfaf051b99b47ac1.png","type":"image"},"title":"Text to Image"},{"media":{"prompt":"Black and white tones, black and white photography highlights the tension of light and shadow, oversized black suit coat, exaggerated wide shoulder design highlights the aura, collar naturally opens, hands naturally insert pockets, coat fabric presents a high-end texture, black straight hair, strong smoky eye makeup with matte lip makeup, sharp and deep eyes, gray gradient background","referImageRight":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ptp-1.8d5a061b6a20c9ed.png","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ptp-2.1bb7b4c55f362b8c.png","type":"image"},"title":"Image to Image"},{"media":{"prompt":"","src":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/multi-image-to-image.png","type":"image"},"title":"Multi-Image to Image"},{"media":{"prompt":"","src":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/image-expansion.png","type":"image"},"title":"Image Expansion"}],"title":"Image Generation","titleTab":"Image Generation API"},{"commentary":"Ideal for virtual try-on scenes ine-commerce, marketing, and entertainment.Supports single-item try-ons (tops,bottoms, full-body outfits) and combination try-ons (top + bottom).","list":[{"media":{"referImageLeftTop":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/tryon-1.3874def17be66c4e.png","referImageRight":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/tryon-2.7cfafdf8c39f50df.png","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-tryon-1.9399c8d0fb7a8791.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Virtual Try-On"}],"title":"Virtual Try-On","titleTab":"Virtual Try-On API"}],"title":"Product Features"},"subTitle":"Access the world’s most popular video and image generation models through secure, easy-to-use, and reliable API online service"},"ja":{"apiVideoUrl":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/page3-video-en.37caf59c5ac36bc6.mp4","coopLogoUrl":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/coop-logo-en.dca2ee412bb2285b.png","demoLogoUrl":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/dev-global-home-logo-250717.png","demos":[{"desc":"プロフェッショナルな創作シーン向けにAI動画生成機能を拡張し、テキストや静止画像からワンクリックで動画を生成することをサポートします。デザイナーやマーケティングチームが高品質な動画を迅速に生成でき、創作ツールの競争力を高め、マネタイズシーンを拡大するのに役立ちます。","title":"プロフェッショナルな創作プラットフォーム","video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-1-jp.d8b437a50e6bb2c6.mp4"},{"desc":"AIエフェクト生成エンジンを提供し、hot人気のエフェクト、古い写真の修復、季節イベントテーマエフェクト、二人用エフェクトなどのクリエイティブな遊び方を実現します。エンタメアプリや各種ソーシャルアプリにおいてユーザーの交流を促進し、ユーザーの粘着性を高め、マネタイズ経路を拡大するのに役立ちます。","title":"エンターテインメント・ソーシャルアプリケーション","video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-2-jp.4db4ba4db86f3ea9.mp4"},{"desc":"商品画像と簡単な説明から自動的に商品展示動画を生成し、マルチエージェント参照に基づき、人と商品のインタラクション・展示を実現し、ファッション、美化粧、3Cなど多くのカテゴリーをカバーしています。商家が高品質なマーケティング素材を大量・効率的・低コストで生成できるよう支援します。","title":"電子商取引マーケティングシーン","video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-3-jp.mp4"}],"modelUpgradeNotice":"動画V2.1モデルのAPIが正式にリリースされ、カリンAIの新しいデジタルヒューマンが登場しました。","models":[{"name":"動画生成","taskTypes":["テキストから動画生成","画像から動画生成","動画の延長","リップシンク","動画エフェクト","複数の画像参照"],"video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-video-bg.cb39536e7c0db6b4.mp4"},{"image":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-image-bg.b4d28687b1639508.png","name":"画像生成","taskTypes":["テキストから画像