平台","video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-1-cn.36a61f11d7b7d2ae.mp4"},{"desc":"提供AI特效生成引擎，实现hot热门特效、老照片修复、节日主题特效、双人特效等创意玩法。帮助娱乐APP和各类社交应用增加用户互动，提升用户粘性，拓展变现路径。","title":"娱乐社交应用","video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-2-cn.39265fc9053069b1.mp4"},{"desc":"通过产品图和简单描述自动生成商品展示视频，基于多主体参考可实现真人与商品互动展示，覆盖服饰、美妆、3C等众多品类。帮助商家批量、高效、低成本制作高质量营销素材。","title":"电商营销场景","video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/demo-3-cn.c5f4a570425ade9f.mp4"}],"modelUpgradeNotice":"视频 V2.5 Turbo 模型正式开放API，可灵AI 全新数字人上线","models":[{"name":"视频生成","taskTypes":["文生视频","图生视频","视频延长","对口型","视频特效","多图参考"],"video":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-video-bg.cb39536e7c0db6b4.mp4"},{"image":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-image-bg.b4d28687b1639508.png","name":"图像生成","taskTypes":["文生图","图生图"]},{"image":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/model-other-bg.b9d03458735fd5bf.png","name":"智能场景","taskTypes":["虚拟试穿"]}],"productFeatures":{"desc":"","productFeaturesList":[{"commentary":"快速接入可灵视频大模型，一键集成文生视频、图生视频、视频延长、对口型、运动笔刷、AI特效等全球领先的视频生成能力","list":[{"media":{"prompt":"摄影机从珊瑚洞内穿过，第一人称视角，高速","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-1.6900686236fd8a15.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"文生视频"},{"media":{"prompt":"男人闭着眼睛慢慢漂浮起来，镜头跟随男人缓慢上升，肢体自然","referImageRight":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ttv.bf155b7345c70c00.png","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-2.f136dcee53d42781.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"图生视频"},{"media":{"src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-3.9dd689c609dc5e87.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"视频延长"},{"media":{"audio":"10″Audio","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-4.6a17a3c0bd109de9.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"对口型"},{"media":{"audio":"5″Audio","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-5.259f7e695133e49c.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"视频特效"},{"media":{"prompt":"女生戴着太阳帽和粉色的眼镜","referImageLeftBottom":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/muti-3.5d035a2024495b57.png","referImageLeftTop":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/muti-1.7798f5d11eefe521.png","referImageRight":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/muti-2.ac0be7c9bb4844f4.png","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-video-6.bdfb682669810c7d.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"多图参考生视频"},{"media":{"audio":"12″Audio","src":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/audio-gen.76de01551dac28ff.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"音效生成"},{"media":{"prompt":"","src":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/multi-elements.ac20a642144e3060.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"多模态视频编辑"}],"title":"视频生成","titleTab":"视频生成 API"},{"commentary":"快速调用兼具真实与美学的图像模型，支持文生图、图生图、角色参考等API接入，一键体验极致的图像创作能力。","list":[{"media":{"prompt":"中景画中是一辆老式红色福特野马敞篷车，正在沙漠中行驶，头顶是蓝天和云彩。汽车停在非常干燥、龟裂的棕色沙地上。油画风格，笔触厚重。","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ttp.cfaf051b99b47ac1.png","type":"image"},"title":"文生图"},{"media":{"prompt":"黑白色调，黑白摄影突显光影张力，超大廓形黑色西装大衣，夸张宽肩设计突显气场，翻领自然敞开，双手自然插兜,大衣面料呈现高级质地，黑色直发，浓烈烟熏眼妆搭配哑光唇妆，眼神犀利深邃，灰色渐变背景","referImageRight":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ptp-1.8d5a061b6a20c9ed.png","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ptp-2.1bb7b4c55f362b8c.png","type":"image"},"title":"图生图"},{"media":{"prompt":"","src":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/multi-image-to-image.png","type":"image"},"title":"多图参考生图"},{"media":{"prompt":"","src":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/image-expansion.png","type":"image"},"title":"扩图"}],"title":"图像生成","titleTab":"图像生成 API"},{"commentary":"适用于电商、营销、娱乐等场景下的人物换装，可实现任意衣服、任意身材、任意动作试穿。","list":[{"media":{"referImageLeftTop":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/tryon-1.3874def17be66c4e.png","referImageRight":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/tryon-2.7cfafdf8c39f50df.png","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-tryon-1.9399c8d0fb7a8791.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"虚拟试穿"}],"title":"虚拟试穿","titleTab":"虚拟试穿 API"}],"title":"产品功能"},"subTitle":"通过安全、易用、可靠的 API 在线服务访问全球最受欢迎的视频生成和图像生成模型"}}</script><script charset="UTF-8">window['kConf_ytech.klingWeb.devModelPageInfo_18n']={"en":{"banner":{"bgUrl":"https://ali.a.yximgs.com/kos/nlav12119/dPgrqRWw_2025-10-13-20-48-56.png","btns":[{"btnText":"Documentation","link":"https://app.klingai.com/global/dev/document-api/apiReference/model/skillsMap","type":"border"},{"action":"contact","btnText":"Contact Us","link":"","type":"border"}],"description":"Volume-tiered discounts available. Consult our specialists for tailored solutions.","title":"Pricing"},"image":{"banner":{"bgUrl":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/banner-image.d5fda9b7533b7bac.png","btns":[{"btnText":"Documentation","link":"https://app.klingai.com/global/dev/document-api/apiReference/model/imageGeneration","type":"border"},{"action":"billing","btnText":"Pricing","link":"https://app.klingai.com/global/dev/document-api/productBilling/prePaidResourcePackage#section-1","type":"border"}],"description":"IMAGE 2.0 offers public APIs, with enhanced prompt adherence, <br>60+ style support, and cinematic-quality visuals","mediaType":"image","title":"Image Generation Model"},"feature":{"list":[{"descriptions":["Supports users to freely input text and supports image content generation of different models and sizes"],"media":{"prompt":"In the mid-ground of the painting is a vintage red Ford Mustang convertible, driving through a desert. Above it are blue skies and clouds. The car is parked on a very dry, cracked brown sandy ground. The style of the painting is oil, with thick brushstrokes.","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ttp.cfaf051b99b47ac1.png","type":"image"},"title":"Text-to-Image"},{"descriptions":["Supports image generation of different models and aspect ratios, and supports complex and controllable generation of character feature references, appearance references, and general references"],"media":{"prompt":"Black and white tones, black and white photography highlight the tension of light and shadow, oversized black suit coat, exaggerated wide shoulder design highlights aura, lapels naturally open, hands naturally in pockets, coat fabric showing high-quality texture, black straight hair, strong smoky eye makeup with matte lip makeup, deep eyes, gray gradient background","referImageRight":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ptp-1.8d5a061b6a20c9ed.png","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/ptp-2.1bb7b4c55f362b8c.png","type":"image"},"title":"Image-to-Image"}],"title":"Product Features"},"package":{"custom":{"btnText":"Click to apply","desc":"Customized Resource Package","tips":"If our standard resource packages don't meet your needs, or if you require customized solutions or bulk purchases, please complete the questionnaire. Our team will promptly contact you to provide a