 purchasing additional resource packages.","Failed image generations will not deduct any unit.","Unused resource package balance does not carry over and will be cleared upon expiration."],"tipsLabel":"More Rules"}],"video":[{"text":"Supports Text to Video, Image to Video, Multi-Image to Video, Multi-Elements, Video Extension, Avatar, Lip Sync, Video Effects, Text to Audio and Video to Audio"},{"text":"Supports Model V1.0, V1.5, V1.6, V2.0, V2.1 and V2.5 turbo","tips":["Concurrent videos = the number of videos being generated simultaneously. The concurrent number does not increase when purchasing additional resource packages.","Failed video generations will not deduct any unit.","Unused resource package balance does not carry over and will be cleared upon expiration."],"tipsLabel":"More Rules"}]},"priceRule":"Due to price differences among various models and modes, please be sure to check the detailed pricing in the billing rules.","tipBtnText":"View Billing Rules","title":"Resource Packages"},"tryOnApi":{"list":[{"table":{"columns":[{"align":"center","key":"model","title":"Model"},{"align":"center","key":"points","title":"Resource Pack Credit Deduction"},{"align":"center","key":"prices","title":"Unit Price (Standard)"}],"data":[{"model":"kolors-virtual-try-on-v1","points":"1","prices":"$0.07"},{"model":"kolors-virtual-try-on-v1-5","points":"1","prices":"$0.07"}]},"title":"Virtual Try-On API"}],"title":"Virtual Try-On API"},"tryon":{"banner":{"bgUrl":"https://p2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-website/dev-home/try-on-bg.f9957534e9d3ffde.png","btns":[{"btnText":"Documentation","link":"https://app.klingai.com/global/dev/document-api/apiReference/model/functionalityTry","type":"border"},{"action":"billing","btnText":"Pricing","link":"https://app.klingai.com/global/dev/document-api/productBilling/prePaidResourcePackage#section-2","type":"border"}],"description":"The virtual try-on V1.5 Model API now available, supporting any clothes, <br>any body shape, and any pose to try on","mediaType":"image","title":"Intelligent Scenarios"},"feature":{"list":[{"descriptions":["Ideal for e-commerce, marketing, entertainment, and other scenarios requiring virtual outfit changes. Supports trying on any clothing, for any body type, in any pose."],"media":{"referImageLeftTop":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/tryon-1.3874def17be66c4e.png","referImageRight":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/images/tryon-2.7cfafdf8c39f50df.png","src":"https://v2-kling.klingai.com/kcdn/cdn-kcdn112452/kling-homepage-aio-prod_aio/assets/videos/model-tryon-1.9399c8d0fb7a8791.mp4","type":"video"},"title":"Virtual Try-On"}],"title":"Product Features"},"package":{"custom":{"btnText":"Click to apply","desc":"Customized Resource Package","tips":"If our standard resource packages don't meet your needs, or if you require customized solutions or bulk purchases, please complete the questionnaire. Our team will promptly contact you to provide assistance.","title":"Custom Resource Package"},"priceRule":"Due to price differences among various models and modes, please be sure to check the detailed pricing in the billing rules.","tipBtnText":"View Billing Rules","title":"Resource Packages"},"usageGuide":{"baseList":[{"desc":"A guide to API invocation.","link":"https://app.klingai.com/global/dev/document-api/quickStart/userManual","title":"Quick Start"},{"desc":"Full list of API capabilities.","link":"https://app.klingai.com/global/dev/document-api/quickStart/featureList","title":"Feature List"},{"desc":"Product/service update announcements.","link":"https://app.klingai.com/global/dev/document-api/apiReference/updateNotice","title":"Updates"}],"subList":[{"desc":"Interface implementation for virtual try-on","link":"https://app.klingai.com/global/dev/document-api/apiReference/model/functionalityTry","title":"Virtual Try-On"}],"subTitle":"Smart Scenario API Reference",